Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|custom.properties|default.layout.template.id=1_column|
		|testray.main.component.name|Documents Management|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Add And Remove Metadata Sets
Priority: 4
	Given ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Documents and Media|
	When DMNavigator goto Metadata Sets
	And DMMetadataSet add
		|dmMetadataSetFieldNames|Text Box|
		|metadataSetName|DM Metadata Set Name|
	And DMMetadataSet save
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Documents and Media|
	And DMNavigator goto Document Type
	And DMDocumentType add
		|dmDocumentTypeDescription|DM Document Type Description|
		|dmDocumentTypeFieldNames|Text Box|
		|dmDocumentTypeName|DM Document Type Name|
		|metadataSetName|DM Metadata Set Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Documents and Media|
	And DMNavigator goto Document Type
	Then DMDocumentType edit
		|dmDocumentTypeName|DM Document Type Name|
		|metadataSetName|DM Metadata Set Name|
		|removeMetadataSet|true|
Scenario: Add Document Type And Metadata
Priority: 3
	Given ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Documents and Media|
	When DMNavigator goto Metadata Sets
	And DMMetadataSet add
		|dmMetadataSetFieldNames|Boolean|
		|metadataSetName|Document Metadata Set Name|
	And DMMetadataSet save
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Documents and Media|
	And DMNavigator goto Document Type
	And DMDocumentType add
		|dmDocumentTypeDescription|DM Document Type Description|
		|dmDocumentTypeFieldNames|Boolean|
		|dmDocumentTypeName|DM Document Type Name|
		|metadataSetName|Document Metadata Set Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Documents and Media|
	And DMDocument add CP
		|dmDocumentDescription|DM Document Type Contract Description|
		|dmDocumentFile|Document_1.doc|
		|dmDocumentTitle|DM Document Type Contract Title|
		|dmDocumentTypeName|DM Document Type Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Documents and Media|
	And DMPortlet set Descriptive View
	And DMNavigator goto Document CP
		|dmDocumentTitle|DM Document Type Contract Title|
	Then DMDocument view CP
		|dmDocumentTitle|DM Document Type Contract Title|
Scenario: Allow Multiple Portlet Configurations Per Site
Priority: 4
	Given ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	When Site add Blank CP
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And ProductMenu goto Site
		|site|Site Name|
	And Page add
		|pageName|Site Page 1|
	And Page add
		|pageName|Site Page 2|
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Site Page 1|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Documents and Media|
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Site Page 2|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Documents and Media|
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Site Page 1|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And DMPortlet configure Display Settings PG
		|enableDisplaySettingsRelatedAssets|false|
		|enableDisplaySettingsShowSearch|false|
		|entriesToDisplayCount|75|
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Site Page 2|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	Then DMPortlet view Default Configuration Display Settings PG
Scenario: Assert File Size Validation
##########################################################
The Poshi description element is not supported in the readable syntax. Please update this test.
##########################################################
	When these properties
		|test.name.skip.portal.instance|DocumentsadministrationUsecase#AssertFileSizeValidation|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Documents and Media|
	And DMDocument add CP
		|dmDocumentDescription|DM Document Description1|
		|dmDocumentFile|Document_1.mp3|
		|dmDocumentTitle|DM Document Title|
	And DMNavigator goto Document CP
		|dmDocumentTitle|DM Document Title|
	And DMDocument view CP
		|dmDocumentSize|4.3MB|
		|dmDocumentTitle|DM Document Title|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Documents and Media|
	And LAR export Portlet
		|larFileName|DM.portlet.lar|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Configuration
		|portlet|Server Administration|
	And AssertClick the value 'File Uploads' at locator 'NavBar#FILE_UPLOADS'
	And Type the value '300000' at locator 'ServerAdministrationFileUploads#DOCS_AND_MEDIA_MAX_FILE_SIZE_FIELD'
	And ScrollWebElementIntoView at locator 'Button#SAVE'
	And AssertClick the value 'Save' at locator 'Button#SAVE'
	And AssertElementPresent the value 'Your request completed successfully.' at locator 'Message#SUCCESS'
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Documents and Media|
	And DMNavigator goto Add Document Type
		|dmDocumentTypeName|${dmDocumentTypeName}|
	And AssertTextEquals the value 'Upload documents no larger than 293KB.' at locator 'Message#INFO'
	And DMDocument edit Cmd
		|dmDocumentFileEdit|Document_1.mp4|
		|dmDocumentTitle|Document_1.mp4|
	And Button click Publish
	And Alert view Request Failed To Complete
	And AssertTextEquals assert Partial Text the value 'Please enter a file with a valid file size no larger than 293KB.' at locator 'Message#ERROR_2'
	And Button click Cancel
	And LAR _goto Export Import
	And AssertElementPresent at locator 'IFrame#DIALOG'
	And LAR _export
		|exportPermissions|${exportPermissions}|
		|larFileName|DM.portlet.lar|
	Then SelectFrame the value 'relative=top'
